## Regulatory context

As of October 20, 2026, no harmonised CRA standard is cited in the Official
Journal, so no presumption of conformity is available from one.
The Commission guidance C(2026) 5252 of July 27, 2026 is non-binding.
Check current sources before making a declaration.

## Review before use

Conformline helps prepare evidence and does not give legal advice.
The EU declaration remains an unsigned draft until a responsible person
reviews and signs it. Conformline does not sign it or submit reports to ENISA.

Requirement: Art. 13, Art. 14; Annex I, II, V and VII.
